# 33_ego_dissolution_gamma.ledc — Non-Dual Gamma / Ego-Dissolution, ~30 min
# ALTERED STATE: the mystical "unity" / ego-dissolution pole of advanced meditation, where the
#   felt boundary between self and world softens. Scaffolding only — the device nudges cortical
#   gamma and provides a comfortable invisible-flicker field; it does NOT install the state
#   (that is the practitioner's own attention & training). Arc: alpha 10 induction -> cross-fade
#   into a 40 Hz GAMMA hold (20 min) -> gentle return to alpha.
#
# V2 FEATURES USED (and why):
#   * LED phase 0 / 180 INVISIBLE-FLICKER PAIR (the flagship) — an amber bank (phase 0) and a
#     complementary blue bank (phase 180) run 40 Hz in ANTIPHASE at matched dim brightness, so
#     mean luminance stays ~flat (little visible flicker, no fatigue over a long hold) while the
#     retina still receives the full 40 Hz oscillation. Amber<->blue is both the strongest SSVEP
#     pair AND luminance-complementary (playbook B1/B8, FLICKER_PAIRS.amberBlue).
#   * Audio beat JITTER (1.5 Hz, 60 s wander) on the binaural gamma channel — over a 20-minute
#     gamma hold a fixed beat habituates; a slow wander of the beat keeps the drive fresh
#     (playbook A3). On a binaural channel jitter wanders the freqR beat offset.
#   * HARMONIC STACK — the 40 Hz gamma is reinforced by an octave-down carrier pair (170/210)
#     sharing the same 40 Hz delta-f, richer bed that reinforces the FFR (playbook A5).
#
# RESEARCH / PATENT CITATION:
#   40 Hz gamma entrainment: entrainment_techniques_playbook.md B4 / §C GENUS template; invisible
#   spectral flicker B1 (Optoceutics US 11,433,253 — we deliberately DO NOT copy the proprietary
#   two-source method; this is the plain public-domain complementary-antiphase idea on our own RGB
#   channels). Harmonic stacking A5. NOTE per patent_landscape_ave.md: 40 Hz is offered here only
#   as an explicit fixed research frequency, framed strictly non-medically (MIT US 10,682,490).
#
# EXPERIMENTAL: the 40 Hz amyloid/therapeutic claim is CONTESTED; the entrainment itself is well
#   established. The "invisible" comfort effect depends on the two colour banks living on physically
#   INTERLEAVED pixels (see channel_map recipe) and an RGB backend; on a brightness-only backend it
#   degrades to two dim 40 Hz zones — still safe, just less invisible.
#
# channel_map recipe (menuconfig CONFIG_LED_CHANNEL_MAP): channels are fixed by temperature/eye
#   (ch0=L-cool bit1, ch1=L-warm bit2, ch2=R-cool bit4, ch3=R-warm bit8). The AMBER (warm) bank
#   rides the WARM bits of both eyes (mask 10 = ch1+ch3), the BLUE (cool) bank the COOL bits of
#   both eyes (mask 5 = ch0+ch2). Interleave warm/cool within each eye, 8-pixel "0,1,2,3,0,1,2,3".
#
# SAFETY / CONTRAINDICATIONS:
#   Do NOT use if you have photosensitive epilepsy, a seizure disorder, or a history of photic
#   migraine. Do not use while driving or operating machinery. Stop if you feel dizzy or unwell.
#   EXPERIENTIAL, not medical. 40 Hz sits ABOVE the 15-25 Hz photosensitive danger band; brightness
#   kept DIM (<=18%); 50% duty keeps a brightness floor; light ramps in 15 s / out 2 min; amber+blue,
#   no saturated-red strobe; audio capped low. Headphones recommended (binaural). Eyes closed.
#
# Duration: ~30 min.  LED cols: time freq duty bright R G B mask env phase
#   Audio: A time freq pan vol mod [ch] [freqR] [wave] [duty] [env] [phase] [attack] [jitter]
# Ramp convention = animate-on-start (the > prefix sits where a segment BEGINS).

# --- Induction / alpha 10 Hz (00:00-02:00): antiphase pair + alpha bed fade in ---
0 40 50 >0 255 140 0 10 0 0                    # AMBER bank (WARM bits, mask 10 = L-warm+R-warm): 40 Hz square, phase 0; bright fade-in
0 40 50 >0 0 120 255 5 0 180                  # BLUE  bank (COOL bits, mask 5 = L-cool+R-cool): 40 Hz, phase 180 (antiphase -> luminance ~flat)
A 0 340 0 >0 0 1 350 0                        # ch1 alpha binaural: carrier 340 / freqR 350 => 10 Hz beat; vol fade-in
S 3000 default 65 "Settle, and let the breath grow slow. We begin softly at ten hertz."
15000 40 50 18 255 140 0 10 0 0                # amber reaches 18% dim cap
15000 40 50 18 0 120 255 5 0 180             # blue reaches 18% (matched -> mean luminance ~steady)
A 60000 340 0 45 0 1 350 0                    # ch1 alpha vol settled 45

# --- Cross-fade into gamma (02:00-05:00): alpha out, 40 Hz binaural + harmonic in ---
A 120000 340 0 >45 0 1 350 0                  # ch1 alpha fades out 45->0
A 300000 340 0 0 0 1 350 0                    # ch1 alpha off
A 120000 340 0 >0 0 2 380 0 50 4 0 3 1.5:60000   # ch2 GAMMA binaural: carrier 340 / freqR 380 => 40 Hz beat; beat jitter 1.5 Hz/60 s
A 300000 340 0 40 0 2 380 0 50 4 0 3 1.5:60000   # ch2 gamma vol settled 40
A 120000 170 0 >0 0 3 210 0                   # ch3 HARMONIC octave-down: 170 / 210 => same 40 Hz delta-f; fade in
A 300000 170 0 22 0 3 210 0                   # ch3 harmonic settled 22 (quieter reinforcing layer)
S 120000 default 65 "Now the field steadies to a gentle forty-hertz shimmer. Let self and surroundings blur at the edges."

# --- GAMMA HOLD (05:00-25:00 = 20 min): antiphase 40 Hz light + binaural + harmonic, jitter on ---
S 300000 default 65 "Rest in open, boundaryless awareness. Nothing to hold, nowhere to stand. Just this."
S 900000 default 65 "Let the sense of a separate centre soften. Vast, still, undivided — and the light asks nothing of your eyes."

# --- Return (25:00-27:00): gamma + harmonic fade, alpha returns ---
A 1500000 340 0 >40 0 2 380 0 50 4 0 3 1.5:60000  # gamma vol fades 40->0
A 1620000 340 0 0 0 2 380 0 50 4 0 3 1.5:60000    # gamma off
A 1500000 170 0 >22 0 3 210 0                 # harmonic fades 22->0
A 1620000 170 0 0 0 3 210 0                   # harmonic off
A 1500000 340 0 >0 0 1 350 0                  # ch1 alpha returns: fade in 0->35
A 1620000 340 0 35 0 1 350 0                  # alpha back at 10 Hz
S 1500000 default 65 "Gently gathering back toward a centre now, carrying the spaciousness with you."

# --- Soft close (27:00-30:00): alpha + antiphase pair fade to 0 ---
A 1680000 340 0 >35 0 1 350 0                 # alpha vol fade 35->0
1680000 40 50 >18 255 140 0 10 0 0            # amber brightness fade 18->0
1680000 40 50 >18 0 120 255 5 0 180          # blue brightness fade 18->0
S 1680000 default 65 "Let the shimmer fade. Rest a moment, then open your eyes, whole and clear."
A 1800000 340 0 0 0 1 350 0                   # end: ch1 vol 0
1800000 40 50 0 255 140 0 10 0 0              # end: amber 0
1800000 40 50 0 0 120 255 5 0 180            # end: blue 0
